    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39502" root="نحس" body-key="n">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتحس</span></b>  <i>He became overthrown,</i> or <i>subverted;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تناحس</span></b> . And the former is also said of
a man's <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدّ</span> [or good fortune]. (A, TA.)

